     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Energy-efficient public services provided in the provinces of Kampot and Kep 
Indicator: 61 streetlights replaced and 751 new streetlights installed in Kampot using LED technology 
Achievement: 0 
Progress/Status: The EPC contract was signed on 2 January 2025, with construction starting in March 2025. In October 2025, the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, the IA for this project output, requested a contract variation of the EPC contract for the installation of 550 additional poles and luminaires in Kep. The number of installations in Kampot remained unchanged. The EPC contract was also extended until 30 June 2026. Based on this variation, construction in both Kampot and Kep is expected to be completed in Q2 2026.
 
